<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">1TAS Arum</book>
  <para style="h">1TASALONIKAWA</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Tasalonikawa</para>
  <para style="toc2">1Tasalonikawa</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Tas</para>
  <para style="mt2">Amgbasho Ablusu Ata jiji ŋoh A na Na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tasalonikawa Mboh</para>
  <para style="imt">IKPI TSIFA</para>
  <para style="im">Tasalonikawa reh tana a bu akpo afiya agba ata Romawa mboh nza a bu ma Makidoniya reh.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Amgbasho Ablusu Ata jiji ŋoh A na Na Tasalonika Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Amgbasho ata areh anyi na Ablusu, tasa Sila, tasa Timoti,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">A na na amboh tufa Yeso mboh nza ma a yama ma Tasalonika nza ma a bu nimeh Nnoh ata nza a bu Ada reh tasa Ada Yeso Kristi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Mya Ablusu meh kwere Nnoh la lisa alindeh ata Nnoh tasa tuma alindeh ta a bu na amohnoh.<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwende Nnoh Tsifa Nga Agohsoh Tasalonikawa mboh ma ikpi shi wuwana Amoh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Meh leh kwende ma Nnoh ni tutu tsifa amohnoh nambri, meh kǝ fi noh nimeh kwere Nnoh na tutu. <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />Mbohroh meh kǝ leh kohnoh na amohnoh ma tohmoh Nnoh ambohroh tasa Ada mbohroh, ma ikpi ndohmoh nga agohsoh amohnoh, tasa ndohmoh kira ata nza ni lisa noh, tasa shi ata nza ni shi wuwana nnoh nimeh sa Ada mbohroh Yeso Kristi.<verse eid="1TH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />ambohroh mboh, Mbohroh meh wina la Nnoh a kira na amohnoh, a seh nnoh za la ti bu noh kyangwri a ŋoh mboh, <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />la meh de tsifa nana ba nnoh a bu na tsifa ma tsene kpeh, meh de ba na wuwana Nnoh za mishi, tasa huru zanana, tasa kira gaga. Mohnoh ni wina noh biroh tuma alindeh ata mbohroh nza meh tuma na amohnoh reh la tsifa amohnoh. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />Mohnoh ni leh nza nyi nnoh na ambohroh tasa ata Ada reh; nimeh iya ata mohnoh nza ni leh wa nnoh reh, ni sa nnoh tsifa ata huru zanana nza nga noh reh na johjoh. <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />amboh tufa mboh nza ma a yama ma Makidoniya tasa Akaya reh tama a nza anyi na amohnoh. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Tsifa Nnoh reh a nati anyi na amohnoh a na akpo afiya Makidoniya tasa Akaya ma tsene kpeh, nga agohsoh amohnoh na Nnoh reh a nati a treh atsifi. Nza a bu dehreh reh meh nati wina bleh andromboh za kpeh, <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />a bu kyangwri mboh na ikpi amoh nza ma leh a bleh tsifa sa ata nza ni sa turoh reh. Ma bleh za la ni ta nnoh nnoh akǝkehreh amohnoh mboh reh ti ba nnoh na Nnoh ata a zizi tasa Nnoh ata nza a bu ni fene ti krumusu nnoh, <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />tasa za la ti bana nnoh amehreh a ŋoh ata nza a nati anyi inza ba, ŋoh ta ka a hinga anyi ma kwo reh, a bu ŋoh Yeso ata nza a nati a sa reh a hwana anyi ma gofo Nnoh ata nza a buti ba reh.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ablusu A te Ndohmoh ma Tasolonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Ni wina noh, atsi amya mboh, la ba ambohroh na amohnoh reh tana a bu were kpeh. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />Mbohroh timi wa iya tasa za tama a kya reh ma Filibi, tswanza ni wina noh reh, Nnoh ambohroh nga reh wuwa agohsoh nza meh bleh noh tsifa nana a ŋoh reh, amboh nza ma a fi reh ma tohmoh za ma a yama. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Tsifa nana ata mbohroh nza meh bleh noh reh a sohroh ba ni kpakpana kpeh, ha na agugu kpeh, ha neh mata a bleh la ma a landa nnoh kpeh. <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />A tswanza Nnoh nza a nza nana amboh reh, a nga reh tsifa nana reh ma ivoh ambohroh, meh ti leh bleh tsifa nana reh, meh bleh la kyangwri mata a nza nana ambohroh kpeh, ta ka bu Nnoh tsene ma ta ka a nza nana ambohroh, ŋoh ata ka a tsara agohsoh ambohroh mboh reh. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />A tswanza nza ni wina noh reh, tsifa ambohroh a bu ata nana aniye kpeh ha ata kira ikpi kpeh, Nnoh za a wina la tsifa reh a bu zizi. <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />Mbohroh meh sohroh fa la kyangwri mboh mata nga reh agba kpeh, ha na amohnoh kpeh, ha na akyo mboh kpeh,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 2:6">Tswanza mbohroh amboh sa tohmoh nana Yeso reh, meh fa la tama a shingi reh, <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />mbohroh neh meh kuku ikpi nimeh amohnoh, a tswanza afiya nza ka a sumu amehreh atisha alindeh reh. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />Mbohroh meh kira na amohnoh gaga, a bu wohroh mbohroh nza meh nza nana meh ti bleh noh tsifa nana Nnoh reh, a bu tsifa Nnoh reh ma tsene kpeh, mbohroh za meh ti nza nana nga noh agohsoh ambohroh, la ni niye turoh ma ahroh. <verse eid="1TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />ambohroh mboh, ni nati kohnoh nnoh la, mehheh kavoh tasa iya mya nza meh leh wa reh, meh te ndohmoh reh na tutu, la meh ti nga ma akyo amohnoh anyi iya kpeh ma atsi ta meh nati bleh noh tsifa nana Nnoh reh.<verse eid="1TH 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Ni bu noh amboh nza ti bleh noh mboh, Nnoh za a bu dehreh, ŋoh nza bu zanana, ta a bu yehlehleh tasa za a ka a kpakpana kpeh, mbohroh timi bu nimeh amohnoh amboh ata nza ni kira nnoh reh nambri. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />Tswanza nza ni wina noh reh, mbohroh meh bleh noh tsifa mboh reh nambri tswanza ada ka a lisa ma mara a ŋoh mboh reh, <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />meh leh bleh noh tsifa mboh reh la ti shi wuwana nnoh, mbohroh meh kwere nnoh la hende amohnoh ta a bu ma aki Nnoh, ŋoh ata nza a fi noh a ba ti bu noh tswanza Nnoh tasa agba a ŋoh.<verse eid="1TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Tasa za mbohroh meh kǝ leh kwende Nnoh reh na tutu tsifa la, nza ni sa nnoh tsifa Nnoh, ata nza ni sehreh nyi nnoh na ambohroh reh, ni sohroh sa nnoh a tswanza a bu tsifa kyangwri mboh kpeh, ni sa nnoh a tswanza a bu tsifa a zizi reh, tsifa Nnoh reh a buti te ndohmoh nimeh amohnoh mohnoh amboh ata nza ni kira nnoh ni tsifa a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />ambohroh mboh, ni bu noh amboh lisa ika ata amboh tufa Nnoh nza ma a yama ma Yahudiya, ata nza ma a bu nimeh Yeso Kristi: mohnoh za ni wa nnoh iya nyi nnoh na kyangwri amohnoh mboh, a tswanza amboh tufa mboh za nza ma a wa iya anyi na Yahudawa mboh reh, <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />amboh ata nza ma a mla Ada mbohroh Yeso tasa amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh reh, mata a gyuru a katsi reh a kate za. Ma a kputu ma Nnoh agohsoh gaga tasa za maka a fi kyangwri mboh ma tohmoh nambri <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />maka a ha reh bleh tsifa Nnoh reh ma amboh ata ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh, la tama a hunji nvara kpeh. ka a bu ma aki wohroh reh kpakpana amoh nza ka a leh a bu gaga reh. Gofo Nnoh reh ka a tamba ma ikpi amoh.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ablusu reh A kohnoh la ŋoh ta A gyuru A na Sene ma Tasalonikawa mboh reh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />ambohroh mboh neh, ameh ata tama ka a gafa reh shidi anyi na amohnoh reh, gafana reh a bu ata itoh a kama a bu ata agohsoh kpeh, meh kǝ leh yoyona, mbohroh za meh kira timi nza noh na ikpi ambohroh. <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />Mbohroh timi kira meh ti ba na amohnoh, mya Ablusu neh, a bu na tutu, Agugu a ha reh ba na amohnoh. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />A bu mboh a nati bu gya agohsoh ambohroh, tasa johjoh ambohroh, ha agamburu ata meh nati gya meh ti kpona na wohroh ma tohmoh Ada Yeso ibi ata ŋoh nza a nati a gyuru a ba reh? Ha a bu mohnoh amboh wohroh kpeh? <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Mbohroh meh nati johjoh tasa za meh ti kpona na amohnoh.<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />Meh nza la meh nati wina de ikpi ahroh wuwa ma ikpi gafana reh za kpeh, meh kǝ nza la a nati a zohhoh mata a yi reh ata ma Atina mbohroh tsimbohro. <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />Ka abu dehreh, Mya Ablusu tasa sila meh kǝ tohmoh Timoti atohngoh ambohroh ma atsi ndomo , a teh ndohmoh Nnoh ma atsi bleh tsifa nana ata kristi, A gya nnoh, a ka nga noh wuwa agohsoh ma ikpi nga agohsoh amohnoh, <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />la akyo ta a kama a teh ni nyina kpeh nimeh wa iya ata areh. mohnoh na ikpi amohnoh ni wina noh la tama a gya la a nati a bu dehreh na ambohroh. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Abu zizi, na ameh ata meh ti kǝ bu na amohnoh, timi kǝ bleh noh la meh nati nza iya. kǝ bu dehreh, tswanza nza ni wina noh. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />A bu dehreh reh, mya za meh wina de ikpi ahroh wuwa kpeh, meh tohmoh ba la meh ti sehreh tsifa nga agohsoh amohnoh, a hwa meh agohsoh la kyangwri tsara agugu reh kǝ kama huru nnoh, la wa iya ambohroh reh ta a kama abu were kpeh.<verse eid="1TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Timoti Atsifa Ata Nga Wuwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Timoti neh kǝ gyuru nyi na amohnoh ba a ŋoh na ambohroh nehnehreh, a de tsifa nana ma ikpi nga agohsoh amohnoh tasa kira amohnoh. tasa ka a bleh reh la ni buti kohnoh nnoh alindeh na ambohroh tasa za la ni kira ti nza turoh, tswanza mbohroh za meh kira meh ti nza noh. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Ma ikpi tsifa ata areh, atsi amya mboh, nimeh hungwa agohsoh ambohroh tasa wa iya ambohroh nambri ni nga turoh wuwa agohsoh ma ikpi amohnoh tsifa nga agohsoh amohnoh reh. <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />nehnehreh mbohroh meh bu na fene, nza ni shi nnoh ni wuwana na Ada. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Meh nati kwende Nnoh lele tsifa amohnoh, ma ikpi johjoh ata nza meh lisa meh tohmoh Nnoh tsifa amohnoh reh? <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />Shini tasa ibi meh kǝ kwere Nnoh yivoh la meh ti hunji nza noh za, tasa meh ti nga nnoh andromboh ata nza anyinana nimeh nga agohsoh amohnoh reh.<verse eid="1TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Nehnehreh ta Nnoh ambohroh, Ada ambohroh ma ikpi a ŋoh tasa Ada ambohroh Yeso kristi ta a vuru reh aki meh ti hunji ba na amohnoh. <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />mohnoh za, Ada ta a shi nnoh kira amohnoh ta a lisa a keh ta abu gaga ma itoh amohnoh tasa mgbiri kyangwri mboh, tswanza mbohroh nza meh lisa nnoh reh. <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />Ada Nnoh ta a lisa a nga noh wuwa agohsoh nimeh zanana, ti tuma noh amboh nza ma a bu na kpakpana kpeh ma tomo Nnoh ata Zizi nza abu Ada ambohroh, na ameh ata Ada ambohroh Yeso a nati a ba, mboh ma amboh zanana a ŋoh mboh nambri reh.<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Hende Ma Aki Ata Nnoh A nati Nza Nana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Ata trina ŋoh, ambohroh mboh meh kwere nnoh, tasa meh ti nga nnoh wuwana agohsoh ma ikpi tsifa Yeso kristi la, ti hende noh ma aki ata nza a nati a zohhoh na amohnoh, hende ma aki ata a nana agohsoh, tswa a nza ti kǝ kpehkpehteh nyi nnoh na ambohroh reh. Meh wina la ni kǝ hende noh ma aki ata areh, lisa yiyina nnoh. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />mohnoh ni wina noh tsifa mboh ata nza meh nga nnoh nimeh wuwana Ada Yeso reh.<verse eid="1TH 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />A bu na kira Nnoh mi la, ta a gyuru nnoh a te amboh zanana mboh: la ti kama fi noh ikpi amohnoh na nnoh ma aki hende leh nnoh ahohndoh na akyo ata nza a bu anzoh kpeh; <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />la nambri ma amohnoh ti de noh ikpi amohnoh ma aki zanana tasa ma aki lisa andromboh nza a bu yehlehleh. <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />Bu nimeh kohnoh abibi tsifa amboh leh ahohndoh kpeh tswanza amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh nza ma a wina Nnoh kpeh reh; <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />tasa za la ma ikpi tsifa ata areh akyo ta a kama kpakpana ma atsini kpeh ha la ta a te ŋoh agugu kpeh ma ikpi de afya leh ahohndoh. Nnoh a nati a nga iya ma kyangwri mboh nambri ma ikpi kpakpana ika wohroh, tswanza meh ti kǝ jiji bleh noh reh, meh ti kǝ kpi nnoh ashotoh reh, <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Nnoh a fi reh la meh ti te arishi kpeh, la meh ti tuma na zanana. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />A bu dehreh, akyo ata nza a leke tsifa ata areh a leke kyangwri kpeh a leke Nnoh Mi, ata nza a nga noh huru zanana a ŋoh.<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Nehnehreh ma ikpi kira tswanza atsi mboh reh a bu la meh ti ŋa ba nnoh kanga kpeh, mohnoh na ikpi amohnoh Nnoh tana a jiji a tsana noh la ti kira nnoh na itoh amohnoh. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />Tasa a bu zizi, ni kira nnoh na atsi mboh nambri ma amoh nza ma a bu ma Makidoniya. Meh lisa nga noh wuwana, ti lisa keh nnoh dehreh.<verse eid="1TH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />Yiyina nnoh ti gya nnoh ikpi amohnoh ma akpo anyimbehreh, lisa sumu nnoh andromboh ata nza a bu ma tohmoh amohnoh, ti kǝ te noh ndohmoh na ivoh amohnoh, tswanza meh ti kǝ tsana noh reh, <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />Nza ni lisa noh dehreh na tutu mgbiri kyangwri amboh ata nza ma a bu amboh tufa Nnoh kpeh ma a nati nga nnoh agba, tasa za, ni nati luhu nnoh akyo tse ta a nga noh andromboh ata nza ni kira nnoh kpeh.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba Nnoh Reh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />ambohroh mboh, meh kira meh ti ta nnoh nimeh shini kpeh ma ikpi amboh ata nza ma a kwo reh, kama kputu nnoh agohsoh amohnoh kpeh tswanza amboh mgbiri nza maka a lisa reh, ma a bu na gya agohsoh kpeh. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Meh nga agohsoh la Yeso a kwo, ta a gyuru a yiri, a bu dehreh za meh nga agohsoh la amboh ata nza ma a kwo nimeh Yeso reh, Nnoh a nati a yiri mboh ma ta ka a jiji a kwo reh mata a ba mboh ma a ŋoh. <verse eid="1TH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Meh bleh noh ata areh anyi na Ada reh: Mbohroh nza meh tre bu na fene na ameh ata Ada nza a nati a gyuru a ba reh, meh nati mishi hinga na amboh ma ta ka a jiji a kwo reh kpeh. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />La a bu Nnoh na ikpi a ŋoh a nati a tamba anyi inza, na fi na wuwana, na agba agbugba mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh tasa wri huya fi ata Nnoh, tasa amboh nza ma a kwo nimeh kristi reh, mboh ma nati jiji a hinga. <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />Neh, Mbohroh amboh nza meh tre yama na fene na ameh wohroh, ma a nati a gu reh Mbohroh ma amboh nimeh avereh, meh ti dohsohna na Nnoh ma inza, meh nati tuma atono na Nnoh. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />A bu dehreh, nga nnoh wuwa agohsoh ma itoh amohnoh na tsifa amboh ata areh.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />nehnehreh, atsi amya mboh, ma ikpi ibi tasa ameh mbohroh meh nati ŋa ba nnoh kpeh, <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />mohnoh ni wina noh yehlehleh la ibi Nnoh reh a nati a ba tswanza ayuhu nza ka a ba nashi ni reh. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />Ameh ata kyangwri mboh ma a nati a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Mbohroh meh tuma alindeh ma na nana agohsoh&gt;&gt;Lofona a nati a ba mboh ma hwana anyimbehreh, a tswanza rina nza ka a de afiya kpanga vru, aki nvara ka a yama kpeh.<verse eid="1TH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />mohnoh atsi mya mboh neh, ni bu noh nimeh shini kpeh la ibi wohroh reh ta a ba ba a hama nnoh tswanza ayuhu kpeh. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Nambri ma amohnoh, ni bu noh mara zanana tasa mara ibi mboh. Mbohroh meh bu ata shini ha ata hungwa kpeh. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />nza ka a bu dehreh, mbohroh meh ti kama leh mla tswanza amboh tswa nza ma a wina Nnoh kpeh maka a leh reh, mbohroh meh ti tuma kya iyo tasa kuku kpi. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />amboh ata nza maka a leh mla reh, maka a leh nashi ni, amboh nza maka a te fiya za maka a te fiya reh nashi ni. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Mbohroh neh nza meh bu ata ibi reh, meh ti kuku ikpi ambohroh, meh ti tuma kya iyo, meh ti were kuri ata nza a wuwana ata gya agohsoh tasa ata nza bu ata kira, tasa za meh ti gya agohsoh hunji nvara, wohroh nza bu agamburu ambohroh ata nza a wuwana. <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Nnoh a seh reh la meh ti bu kyangwri a ŋoh mboh la ŋoh ta a te gofo na ambohroh kpeh. A seh reh la meh ti hunji nvara a ŋoh ma aki andromboh ata Ada Yeso kristi nza a lisa reh, <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />Yeso reh a kwo tsifa ambohroh, la ha meh tre bu na fene ha neh mbohroh meh kwo, la mbohroh nambri meh ti tuma mbohroh ma ŋoh. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Tsifa la, ti shingi nnoh itoh amohnoh, ti nga nnoh wuwa agohsoh ma itoh amohnoh, tswanza ni kǝ lisa nnoh reh.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsifa Ata Trina ŋoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />ambohroh mboh, meh kwere nnoh la ti nga nnoh agba ma amboh ata ma a te ndohmoh na wuwana nimeh amohnoh reh, amboh ata nza ma a bu agbugba amohnoh mboh nimeh sa Ada, maka akpi nnoh ashotoh za. <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />De mboh nnoh alindeh, ti tsana mboh nnoh kira gaga tsifa ndohmoh amoh. Ti tuma noh alindeh na itoh amohnoh. <verse eid="1TH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />ambohroh mboh, meh gyuru bleh noh za la, ti kpi nnoh ashotoh ma amboh ata ma bu yangru ma reh, ti nga nnoh wuwa agohsoh ma amboh ata ma a bu na wuwa agohsoh kpeh reh, ti shingi nnoh amboh ata ma anyinana reh, ti soh nnoh ivoh ma yira na kyangwri mboh nambri. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Lisa nza noh feh, akyo ta kama a te agugu ma akyo ata nza a te ŋoh agugu kpeh, mohnoh neh ti lisa nnoh andromboh alindeh ma itoh amohnoh tasa na kyangwri mboh nambri.<verse eid="1TH 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Ti leh johjoh nnoh na tutu. <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />Ti kǝ leh kwere nnoh Nnoh reh nina ma; <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />ha a ka bu mboh a nati a hunji noh, Kwende noh Nnoh reh nina ma, Nnoh reh a kira la ti lisa nnoh dehreh, tsifa la andromboh ata Yeso kristi nza a lisa nnoh reh.<verse eid="1TH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />Kama ha nnoh tsifa huru zanana Nnoh nza a bu nimeh amohnoh reh kpeh. <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />Kama rina nnoh tsifa ata kyangwri bleh tsifa Nnoh a bleh nza a bleh ma akyo anyi ti leke nnoh kpeh. <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />Tsara awumu mboh reh nza noh nambri feh, ti de noh andromboh ata nza a zohhoh reh. <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />Gbo ta nnoh awumu abibi mboh reh nambri.<verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Ta Nnoh na kpi a ŋoh, ŋoh ata ka a de tuma alindeh a ba, ta a hwara nnoh fyafya. Ta a gyuru a lisa a nza huru, yafa, tasa itoh amohnoh mboh nambri mata a bu na kpakpana kpeh ma ibi ata Ada ambohroh Yeso a nati a gyuru a ba reh. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Ŋoh ata nza a fi noh reh ka a bleh tsifa yehlehleh, a nati a lisa nnoh.<verse eid="1TH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />ambohroh mboh amboh tufa mboh, kwere turoh Nnoh. <verse eid="1TH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Tsifa nnoh na mgbiri ambohroh mboh amboh tufa mboh reh ti fla mboh nnoh de na johjoh ata zanana. <verse eid="1TH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Meh kwere nnoh amboh tufa mboh nimeh sa Ada, la ti bleh noh amgbasho reh ma mgbiri amohnoh mboh reh.<verse eid="1TH 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Lisa alindeh ata Ada Yeso kristi reh ta a bu na amohnoh.<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>